{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.176.231.201","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78651,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b44cb79707dd88cd49416c3af8cc9a6b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hello Ladies!! Just wondering if any of you are planning or have planned a wedding at the OGX? I would love someone to chat with. I&#039;m just starting out and could use some tips :wacko:&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1883627,"PostDate":1421847120,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hello Ladies!! Just wondering if any of you are planning or have planned a wedding at the OGX? I would love someone to chat with. I'm just starting out and could use some tips <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wacko.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':wacko:' \/>\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"christierwayne@gmail.com","IpAddress":"70.211.64.103","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1421184200,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281717.jpg?_r=1463450118","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"Christie77","Id":281717,"Name":"Christie77","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"67.17.215.182","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78651,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1421853556,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"32342dddafc36fe0d655fb863b3cb97c","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Christie77\" post=\"1883627\" timestamp=\"1421861520\"]\nHello Ladies!! Just wondering if any of you are planning or have planned a wedding at the OGX? I would love someone to chat with. I&#039;m just starting out and could use some tips :wacko:[\/quote]\n[size=1][font=calibri][size=1][font=calibri]I just got married at the OGX :lol: . Maybe I can help you with some details.\nTip # 1 \u2013 Make sure your coordinator is Luz.  She is super super accommodating. [\/font][\/size][\/font][\/size]\n[size=1][font=calibri][size=1][font=calibri]Tip # 2 \u2013 Request that your guests stay in buildings 19, 20, 21.  These buildings are close to each other and surround the snack bar. [\/font][\/size][\/font][\/size]","Attachments":[],"Id":1883639,"PostDate":1421852721,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Christie77, on 21 January 2015 - 01:32 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hello Ladies!! Just wondering if any of you are planning or have planned a wedding at the OGX? I would love someone to chat with. I'm just starting out and could use some tips <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wacko.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':wacko:' \/><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:medium\"><span  style=\"font-family:calibri\"><span  style=\"font-size:medium\"><span  style=\"font-family:calibri\">I just got married at the OGX <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/laugh.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':lol:' \/>\u00a0. Maybe I can help you with some details.<br>\nTip # 1 \u2013 Make sure your coordinator is Luz. \u00a0She is super super accommodating. <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:medium\"><span  style=\"font-family:calibri\"><span  style=\"font-size:medium\"><span  style=\"font-family:calibri\">Tip # 2 \u2013 Request that your guests stay in buildings 19, 20, 21. \u00a0These buildings are close to each other and surround the snack bar. <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Our\u00a0perfect wedding in the Riviera Maya.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Date:\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 01\/15\/2015<\/p>\n<p>Resort:\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Occidental Grand Xcaret - Riviera Maya, Mexico<br>\nGuests:\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a070-80<br>\nPackage:\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0Custom<\/p>\n<p>Dress:\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 David's Bridal<br>\nMinister:\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0Family Friend<\/p>\n<p>Photographer:\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0Decordova Photography ( <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.decordova.ca'>www.decordova.ca<\/a> )<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"emma.palmer.love@gmail.com","IpAddress":"67.17.215.182","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1419930757,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"emmapalmer","Id":281523,"Name":"emmapalmer","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.176.231.201","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78651,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"db0b943bf9b8cdc3a138e085b96e0b9c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi emmapalmer!!&amp;nbsp; Thank you for the reply.&amp;nbsp; My fianc\u00e9e and I were engaged there in November and I just love it there. Good thinking about buildings 19-21. Perfect spot all close to food and the swim up bar!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;The coordinator that emailed my Travel Agent is Carolina. Not sure if I can switch?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;How many people did you have at your wedding? What package did you go with if you don&#039;t mind my asking?&lt;\/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p&gt;Oh and congratulations on your wedding emmapalmer!!! So exciting :D&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1883647,"PostDate":1421854068,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi emmapalmer!!\u00a0 Thank you for the reply.\u00a0 My fianc\u00e9e and I were engaged there in November and I just love it there. Good thinking about buildings 19-21. Perfect spot all close to food and the swim up bar!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>The coordinator that emailed my Travel Agent is Carolina. Not sure if I can switch?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>How many people did you have at your wedding? What package did you go with if you don't mind my asking?<\/p>\n<br \/><p>Oh and congratulations on your wedding emmapalmer!!! So exciting <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/biggrin.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':D' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"christierwayne@gmail.com","IpAddress":"70.211.64.103","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1421184200,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281717.jpg?_r=1463450118","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"Christie77","Id":281717,"Name":"Christie77","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"67.17.215.182","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78651,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1422036402,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0646c9ce05caf1a31ffd3e7936ed4d3b","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Christie77\" post=\"1883647\" timestamp=\"1421868468\"]\nHi emmapalmer!!  Thank you for the reply.  My fianc\u00e9e and I were engaged there in November and I just love it there. Good thinking about buildings 19-21. Perfect spot all close to food and the swim up bar!\n\nThe coordinator that emailed my Travel Agent is Carolina. Not sure if I can switch?\n\n\nHow many people did you have at your wedding? What package did you go with if you don&#039;t mind my asking?\n\nOh and congratulations on your wedding emmapalmer!!! So exciting :D[\/quote]\n\n[size=1][font=calibri]It\u2019s lovely that you are getting married in the same location of your engagement, congratulations!!  I don\u2019t know if you can choose the coordinator. Luz was the first to communicate with us from our initial enquiry and that is just who we stuck with. We were super super happy with her planning and execution of our day. [\/font][\/size]\n\n[size=1][font=calibri]We didn\u2019t have a standard package. Instead Luz created a custom package do to special circumstances. The ceremony was held at the cabana although we really would have preferred it at the ruins ( we were past the guest capacity for this site ). We had almost 80 guests attend, we brought our own minister ( family friend ),  and brought our own photographer ( Decordova Photography \/ [url=\"http:\/\/www.decordova.ca\"]www.decordova.ca[\/url] ), and my girls made the bouquets.[\/font][\/size]\n\n[size=1][font=calibri]What package are you looking to get? [\/font][\/size]\n[size=1][font=calibri]If your guest list is 30 ( I think ) or less you can request the ruins. It\u2019s really beautiful!!![\/font][\/size]","Attachments":[],"Id":1883882,"PostDate":1422036217,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Christie77, on 21 January 2015 - 03:27 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hi emmapalmer!!\u00a0 Thank you for the reply.\u00a0 My fianc\u00e9e and I were engaged there in November and I just love it there. Good thinking about buildings 19-21. Perfect spot all close to food and the swim up bar!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>The coordinator that emailed my Travel Agent is Carolina. Not sure if I can switch?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>How many people did you have at your wedding? What package did you go with if you don't mind my asking?<\/p>\n<br><p>Oh and congratulations on your wedding emmapalmer!!! So exciting <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/biggrin.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':D' \/><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:medium\"><span  style=\"font-family:calibri\">It\u2019s lovely that you are getting married in the same location of your engagement, congratulations!! \u00a0I don\u2019t know if you can choose the coordinator. Luz was the first to communicate with us from our initial enquiry and that is just who we stuck with. We were super super happy with her planning and execution of our day. <\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:medium\"><span  style=\"font-family:calibri\">We didn\u2019t have a standard package. Instead Luz created a custom package do to special circumstances. The ceremony was held at the cabana although we really would have preferred it at the ruins ( we were past the guest capacity for this site ). We had almost 80 guests attend, we brought our own minister ( family friend ), \u00a0and brought our own photographer\u00a0( Decordova Photography \/ <a href='http:\/\/www.decordova.ca' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>www.decordova.ca<\/a> ), and my girls made the bouquets.<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:medium\"><span  style=\"font-family:calibri\">What package are you looking to get? <\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:medium\"><span  style=\"font-family:calibri\">If your guest list is 30 ( I think )\u00a0or less\u00a0you can request the ruins. It\u2019s really beautiful!!!<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Our\u00a0perfect wedding in the Riviera Maya.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Date:\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 01\/15\/2015<\/p>\n<p>Resort:\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Occidental Grand Xcaret - Riviera Maya, Mexico<br>\nGuests:\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a070-80<br>\nPackage:\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0Custom<\/p>\n<p>Dress:\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 David's Bridal<br>\nMinister:\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0Family Friend<\/p>\n<p>Photographer:\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0Decordova Photography ( <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.decordova.ca'>www.decordova.ca<\/a> )<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"emma.palmer.love@gmail.com","IpAddress":"67.17.215.182","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1419930757,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"emmapalmer","Id":281523,"Name":"emmapalmer","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.176.231.201","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78651,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4ea37734a4f8376711e07b65817d4c1b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Not knowing how many guests we&#039;ll have stinks! lol. We are inviting 80-ish, but who knows how many will actually be able to attend. The gazebo is gorgeous is gorgeous, and was the initial reason I really wanted to get married there.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1887522,"PostDate":1424881178,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Not knowing how many guests we'll have stinks! lol. We are inviting 80-ish, but who knows how many will actually be able to attend. The gazebo is gorgeous is gorgeous, and was the initial reason I really wanted to get married there.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"christierwayne@gmail.com","IpAddress":"70.211.64.103","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1421184200,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281717.jpg?_r=1463450118","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"Christie77","Id":281717,"Name":"Christie77","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":5,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":1,"Type":"int"}]}
