> User gturano721 (287071)
Request Time: 1 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"173.3.51.164","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76255,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d0618dc3399ee2a3fcc1d49297a9ffd8","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hello brides,&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;This is my first post here on BDW! I have come across a dilemma and am in desperate need of your opinions and advice. I have fallen in love with photos that I have seen of weddings taking place at Xcaret eco park. Although I went to Mexico last month for sight inspections I didn&#039;t visit the park as at that time I was not considering it for the wedding. During the site inspection we settled on Moon Palace for a late December, 2014 wedding. However, seeing the photos now I am very strongly considering changing everything (we haven&#039;t signed any contracts yet) and having the wedding at the park instead. My two caveats are that I don&#039;t like the Occidental Grand Xcaret connected to the park and would need to a find a different hotel that&#039;s located nearby, and I would need a Jewish ceremony to take place at the park and being that the park is famous for its chapel I don&#039;t know if it&#039;s possible. However, I did some research and have come across the Ponds location which I think might work for a Jewish ceremony.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;If anyone has any insights could you please share your thoughts on this? Is it worth having the wedding at Xcaret? Would it still be beautiful if we had the ceremony at the ponds (all of the videos and photos that I&#039;ve seen were from the chapel)? Has anyone seen the ponds location and can shed some light on it? Also, I don&#039;t even know whether or not it is possible to have a Jewish ceremony at this park so would love some insights on this as well. Lastly, if anyone can suggest a hotel that&#039;s conveniently located and is nice I would appreciate it.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thanks in advance!!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1831747,"PostDate":1391515248,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hello brides,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>This is my first post here on BDW! I have come across a dilemma and am in desperate need of your opinions and advice. I have fallen in love with photos that I have seen of weddings taking place at Xcaret eco park. Although I went to Mexico last month for sight inspections I didn't visit the park as at that time I was not considering it for the wedding. During the site inspection we settled on Moon Palace for a late December, 2014 wedding. However, seeing the photos now I am very strongly considering changing everything (we haven't signed any contracts yet) and having the wedding at the park instead. My two caveats are that I don't like the Occidental Grand Xcaret connected to the park and would need to a find a different hotel that's located nearby, and I would need a Jewish ceremony to take place at the park and being that the park is famous for its chapel I don't know if it's possible. However, I did some research and have come across the Ponds location which I think might work for a Jewish ceremony.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>If anyone has any insights could you please share your thoughts on this? Is it worth having the wedding at Xcaret? Would it still be beautiful if we had the ceremony at the ponds (all of the videos and photos that I've seen were from the chapel)? Has anyone seen the ponds location and can shed some light on it? Also, I don't even know whether or not it is possible to have a Jewish ceremony at this park so would love some insights on this as well. Lastly, if anyone can suggest a hotel that's conveniently located and is nice I would appreciate it.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks in advance!!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"brodski.m@gmail.com","IpAddress":"173.3.51.164","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1387913156,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"MBK","Id":275728,"Name":"MBK","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"171.161.160.10","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76255,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fd497bc9f17cd5936f32575247802f9c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;i love xcaret however, the prices are very high. Also considering the distance that will take my guests to get there i did not go for it. I strngly recommend you contact them and ask for the prices and what it includes ( i did my math and it would cost mor ethan double whats costing me now)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;The park is beautiful! but you need to consider whats a priority for you.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;good luck!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1831778,"PostDate":1391519753,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>i love xcaret however, the prices are very high. Also considering the distance that will take my guests to get there i did not go for it. I strngly recommend you contact them and ask for the prices and what it includes ( i did my math and it would cost mor ethan double whats costing me now)<\/p>\n<p>The park is beautiful! but you need to consider whats a priority for you.<\/p>\n<p>good luck!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"cardenas.carla@gmail.com","IpAddress":"171.159.194.11","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1378978345,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"none"},"FormattedName":"Carlicardenas","Id":273425,"Name":"Carlicardenas","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.88.142.22","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76255,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1391553894,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"47492c3f7464ec2aa7fa0ad8f91dbba6","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I too really wanted Xcaret, but after getting a quote from them it was just priced too outragious for me. Over $22,000 for just the reception!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Also, Occidental Xcaret would not be my choice for a resort :\/ If you are going to do the wedding at Xcaret, I would look into another resort in that area that is a little nicer.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1831952,"PostDate":1391553794,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I too really wanted Xcaret, but after getting a quote from them it was just priced too outragious for me. Over $22,000 for just the reception!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Also, Occidental Xcaret would not be my choice for a resort :\/ If you are going to do the wedding at Xcaret, I would look into another resort in that area that is a little nicer.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"color:#00ffff;\"><span style=\"font-size:36px;\"><span style=\"font-family:'lucida sans unicode', 'lucida grande', sans-serif;\">*~Leslie~*<\/span><\/span><\/span> <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wub.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':wub:' \/>","Email":"ltalbott78@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.88.142.22","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1366585191,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-268835.jpg?_r=1391394238","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"travelgal78","Id":268835,"Name":"travelgal78","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"173.3.51.164","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76255,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"864f74fca7372766baac21e9e1a4bac1","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Thank you for your responses! I will stick with Moon Palace.. it&#039;s just easier for everyone and still beautiful =)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1832158,"PostDate":1391638502,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Thank you for your responses! I will stick with Moon Palace.. it's just easier for everyone and still beautiful =)<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"brodski.m@gmail.com","IpAddress":"173.3.51.164","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1387913156,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"MBK","Id":275728,"Name":"MBK","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"187.252.44.28","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76255,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ec9b8c23a5e01b2865e8c813cf8f98aa","RawContent":"[quote name=\"MBK\" post=\"1831747\" timestamp=\"1391529648\"]\nHello brides,\n\nThis is my first post here on BDW! I have come across a dilemma and am in desperate need of your opinions and advice. I have fallen in love with photos that I have seen of weddings taking place at Xcaret eco park. Although I went to Mexico last month for sight inspections I didn&#039;t visit the park as at that time I was not considering it for the wedding. During the site inspection we settled on Moon Palace for a late December, 2014 wedding. However, seeing the photos now I am very strongly considering changing everything (we haven&#039;t signed any contracts yet) and having the wedding at the park instead. My two caveats are that I don&#039;t like the Occidental Grand Xcaret connected to the park and would need to a find a different hotel that&#039;s located nearby, and I would need a Jewish ceremony to take place at the park and being that the park is famous for its chapel I don&#039;t know if it&#039;s possible. However, I did some research and have come across the Ponds location which I think might work for a Jewish ceremony.\n\nIf anyone has any insights could you please share your thoughts on this? Is it worth having the wedding at Xcaret? Would it still be beautiful if we had the ceremony at the ponds (all of the videos and photos that I&#039;ve seen were from the chapel)? Has anyone seen the ponds location and can shed some light on it? Also, I don&#039;t even know whether or not it is possible to have a Jewish ceremony at this park so would love some insights on this as well. Lastly, if anyone can suggest a hotel that&#039;s conveniently located and is nice I would appreciate it.\n\nThanks in advance!!![\/quote]Hey MBK,\n\nAs wedding planners in the Riviera Maya we definitely agree with everyone, Xcaret is a beautiful location.\n\nOther option would be to have only the ceremony there and take your reception at a nearer location.\n\nWe actually have a bride who is doing that in May this year! \n\nIf you may have any more questions, shoot us an email and we will be happy to help !\n\nweddingsinplayadelcarmen@[member=\"gmail\"].com","Attachments":[],"Id":1834226,"PostDate":1392654304,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>MBK, on 04 February 2014 - 12:00 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hello brides,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>This is my first post here on BDW! I have come across a dilemma and am in desperate need of your opinions and advice. I have fallen in love with photos that I have seen of weddings taking place at Xcaret eco park. Although I went to Mexico last month for sight inspections I didn't visit the park as at that time I was not considering it for the wedding. During the site inspection we settled on Moon Palace for a late December, 2014 wedding. However, seeing the photos now I am very strongly considering changing everything (we haven't signed any contracts yet) and having the wedding at the park instead. My two caveats are that I don't like the Occidental Grand Xcaret connected to the park and would need to a find a different hotel that's located nearby, and I would need a Jewish ceremony to take place at the park and being that the park is famous for its chapel I don't know if it's possible. However, I did some research and have come across the Ponds location which I think might work for a Jewish ceremony.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>If anyone has any insights could you please share your thoughts on this? Is it worth having the wedding at Xcaret? Would it still be beautiful if we had the ceremony at the ponds (all of the videos and photos that I've seen were from the chapel)? Has anyone seen the ponds location and can shed some light on it? Also, I don't even know whether or not it is possible to have a Jewish ceremony at this park so would love some insights on this as well. Lastly, if anyone can suggest a hotel that's conveniently located and is nice I would appreciate it.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks in advance!!!<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>Hey MBK,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>As wedding planners in the Riviera Maya we definitely agree with everyone, Xcaret is a beautiful location.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Other option would be to have only the ceremony there and take your reception at a nearer location.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We actually have a bride who is doing that in May this year!\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>If you may have any more questions, shoot us an email and we will be happy to help !<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>weddingsinplayadelcarmen@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"219734\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/219734-gmail\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">gmail<\/span><\/a>.com<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Dream Weddings Riviera Maya- We pay attention to your wishes and coordinate closely with you to ensure your wedding or event is planned to perfection! Supporting you brides and help you feel less overwhelmed during the wedding planning process.<\/p>\n<p>Have fun the best is yet to come!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>This is where I will be posting all videos about most common question about Destination wedding<\/p>\n<p> <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/groups\/1664036763874450\/'>https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/groups\/1664036763874450\/<\/a><br><br><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Dream Weddings Riviera Maya<\/span><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">weddingsinplayadelcarmen@gmail.com<\/span><\/span><br><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.dreamweddingsrivieramaya.com\/Home_Page.html\">http:\/\/www.dreamweddingsrivieramaya.com\/Home_Page.html<\/a><br><br><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Happy Planning!<\/span><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Joyce<\/span><\/span><\/span>","Email":"weddingsinplayadelcarmen@gmail.com","IpAddress":"187.252.44.28","GroupId":84,"GroupName":"Insiders w\/ Articles","JoinDate":1326839987,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-250090.jpg?_r=1451923195","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"dreamweddings","Id":250090,"Name":"dreamweddings","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":5,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":1,"Type":"int"}]}
