Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.189.104.53","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79903,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"694b9e8101bc4f1de33fcd5d774a3307","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hey Everyone!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;New here!&amp;nbsp; We are&amp;nbsp;getting married February of 2017 (open on dates).  I have narrowed it down with the help of the FI and friends to 5 resorts:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Royal Playa Del Carmen;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;El Dorado Royale;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;El Dorado Casitas (same property as Royale);&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;El Dorado Seaside Suites;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Excellence Riviera Cancun; and&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Excellence Playa Mujeres.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We got details today from a TA that narrow it down more and are leaning toward Excellence Playa Mujeres.&amp;nbsp; So excited to find this forum and start this journey!!!!!!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Any direction to help would be more than welcome as I am completely new to this type of&amp;nbsp;planning.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1910196,"PostDate":1454029680,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hey Everyone!\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>New here!\u00a0 We are\u00a0getting married February of 2017 (open on dates).\u00a0\u00a0I have narrowed it down with the help of the FI and friends to 5 resorts:<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Royal Playa Del Carmen;<\/p>\n<p>El Dorado Royale;<\/p>\n<p>El Dorado Casitas (same property as Royale);<\/p>\n<p>El Dorado Seaside Suites;<\/p>\n<p>Excellence Riviera Cancun; and<\/p>\n<p>Excellence Playa Mujeres.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We got details today from a TA that narrow it down more and are leaning toward Excellence Playa Mujeres.\u00a0 So excited to find this forum and start this journey!!!!!!\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Any direction to help would be more than welcome as I am completely new to this type of\u00a0planning.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mam9p8@gmail.com","IpAddress":"70.189.104.53","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1454028966,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"mam9p8","Id":286077,"Name":"mam9p8","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"142.161.170.48","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79903,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1454087636,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c9401dca17826ede26a4dd39c52d8b9b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Congrats on your upcoming dw and joining this helpful forum community, mam9p8!!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;You&#039;ll find everyone really helpful here with sharing info, and in offering suggestions + advice + support to assist you with your planning decisions, so well done on getting off to an awesome start already :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;To show you what some of the venues you&#039;re considering would look like in your wedding photos, (and since a picture is worth a thousand words! ) here are some magical moments that matter we captured there.....enjoy!!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;....from our &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10152516859384487.1073741901.18683524486&amp;amp;type=3&#039;&gt;Royal PdC Wedding Story Album:&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-ord1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xlp1\/t31.0-8\/10505240_10152516860859487_4312839220790079774_o.jpg\" alt=\"10505240_10152516860859487_4312839220790\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-ord1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xpl1\/t31.0-8\/10397119_10152516861699487_2016771516330569174_o.jpg\" alt=\"10397119_10152516861699487_2016771516330\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-ord1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xtf1\/t31.0-8\/10468123_10152516862839487_1001871744561080720_o.jpg\" alt=\"10468123_10152516862839487_1001871744561\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-ord1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xap1\/t31.0-8\/10431323_10152516866014487_3242564933902796138_o.jpg\" alt=\"10431323_10152516866014487_3242564933902\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;...from our &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10153334398819487.1073741930.18683524486&amp;amp;type=3&#039;&gt;El Dorado Royale Wedding Story Album:&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-ord1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xpa1\/t31.0-8\/11357362_10153334400804487_6980102379068326823_o.jpg\" alt=\"11357362_10153334400804487_6980102379068\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-ord1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xpa1\/t31.0-8\/11312665_10153334403249487_3340231076821360239_o.jpg\" alt=\"11312665_10153334403249487_3340231076821\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-ord1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xpt1\/t31.0-8\/11053458_10153334403479487_2029360039488213852_o.jpg\" alt=\"11053458_10153334403479487_2029360039488\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;...from our &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10152498670514487.1073741900.18683524486&amp;amp;type=3&#039;&gt;Excellence Riviera Cancun Wedding Story Album:&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-ord1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xaf1\/t31.0-8\/10339269_10152498672659487_954502207598911299_o.jpg\" alt=\"10339269_10152498672659487_9545022075989\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-ord1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-frc3\/t31.0-8\/10382052_10152498675634487_6244806697421953761_o.jpg\" alt=\"10382052_10152498675634487_6244806697421\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-ord1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xft1\/t31.0-8\/10453012_10152498677914487_2192352328609361964_o.jpg\" alt=\"10453012_10152498677914487_2192352328609\"&gt;.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;....from our &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10152404851779487.1073741891.18683524486&amp;amp;type=3&#039;&gt;Excellence Playa Mujeres Wedding Story Album: &lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-ord1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xpl1\/t31.0-8\/10317723_10152404854154487_1793466072107394031_o.jpg\" alt=\"10317723_10152404854154487_1793466072107\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-ord1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xpt1\/t31.0-8\/10256706_10152404855014487_3193755926411654613_o.jpg\" alt=\"10256706_10152404855014487_3193755926411\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-ord1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xfa1\/t31.0-8\/10380130_10152404855674487_203633112624007769_o.jpg\" alt=\"10380130_10152404855674487_2036331126240\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-ord1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xaf1\/t31.0-8\/10258239_10152404858159487_768149127048100860_o.jpg\" alt=\"10258239_10152404858159487_7681491270481\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Wishing you happy research, and all the best with your wonderful journey ahead - cheers!!! team MTM :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1910233,"PostDate":1454087450,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Congrats on your upcoming dw and joining this helpful forum community, mam9p8!!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>You'll find everyone really helpful here with sharing info, and in offering suggestions + advice + support to assist you with your planning decisions, so well done on getting off to an awesome start already <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>To show you what some of the venues you're considering would look like in your wedding photos, (and since a picture is worth a thousand words! ) here are some magical moments that matter we captured there.....enjoy!!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>....from our <a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10152516859384487.1073741901.18683524486&type=3' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Royal PdC Wedding Story Album:<\/a><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-ord1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xlp1\/t31.0-8\/10505240_10152516860859487_4312839220790079774_o.jpg\" alt=\"10505240_10152516860859487_4312839220790\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-ord1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xpl1\/t31.0-8\/10397119_10152516861699487_2016771516330569174_o.jpg\" alt=\"10397119_10152516861699487_2016771516330\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-ord1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xtf1\/t31.0-8\/10468123_10152516862839487_1001871744561080720_o.jpg\" alt=\"10468123_10152516862839487_1001871744561\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-ord1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xap1\/t31.0-8\/10431323_10152516866014487_3242564933902796138_o.jpg\" alt=\"10431323_10152516866014487_3242564933902\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>...from our <a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10153334398819487.1073741930.18683524486&type=3' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>El Dorado Royale Wedding Story Album:<\/a><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-ord1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xpa1\/t31.0-8\/11357362_10153334400804487_6980102379068326823_o.jpg\" alt=\"11357362_10153334400804487_6980102379068\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-ord1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xpa1\/t31.0-8\/11312665_10153334403249487_3340231076821360239_o.jpg\" alt=\"11312665_10153334403249487_3340231076821\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-ord1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xpt1\/t31.0-8\/11053458_10153334403479487_2029360039488213852_o.jpg\" alt=\"11053458_10153334403479487_2029360039488\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>...from our <a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10152498670514487.1073741900.18683524486&type=3' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Excellence Riviera Cancun Wedding Story Album:<\/a><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-ord1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xaf1\/t31.0-8\/10339269_10152498672659487_954502207598911299_o.jpg\" alt=\"10339269_10152498672659487_9545022075989\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-ord1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-frc3\/t31.0-8\/10382052_10152498675634487_6244806697421953761_o.jpg\" alt=\"10382052_10152498675634487_6244806697421\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-ord1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xft1\/t31.0-8\/10453012_10152498677914487_2192352328609361964_o.jpg\" alt=\"10453012_10152498677914487_2192352328609\"><\/span>.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>....from our <a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10152404851779487.1073741891.18683524486&type=3' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Excellence Playa Mujeres Wedding Story Album: <\/a><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-ord1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xpl1\/t31.0-8\/10317723_10152404854154487_1793466072107394031_o.jpg\" alt=\"10317723_10152404854154487_1793466072107\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-ord1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xpt1\/t31.0-8\/10256706_10152404855014487_3193755926411654613_o.jpg\" alt=\"10256706_10152404855014487_3193755926411\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-ord1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xfa1\/t31.0-8\/10380130_10152404855674487_203633112624007769_o.jpg\" alt=\"10380130_10152404855674487_2036331126240\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-ord1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xaf1\/t31.0-8\/10258239_10152404858159487_768149127048100860_o.jpg\" alt=\"10258239_10152404858159487_7681491270481\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wishing you happy research, and all the best with your wonderful journey ahead - cheers!!! team MTM <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/i1378.photobucket.com\/albums\/ah106\/ContactIDoMexico\/MTM%20Logo%202016_zps4tzm05my.png\" alt=\"MTM%20Logo%202016_zps4tzm05my.png\"><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com'><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Moments That Matter Photography , Cancun, Playa del Carmen, Mexico<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Canadian Award Winning Photojournalist serving the Riviera Maya<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Email: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com'>contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#0000cd;\"><strong>Why we're Ranked #1<\/strong><\/span> ~ Scoop on what we do:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21512-moments-that-matter-photography\/'>MTM Reviews<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Meet Lincoln & Team MTM: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/vimeo.com\/51032621'>\"Meet Lincoln\" Video + see his Passion!!!<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#0000cd;\"><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', cursive;\">We Offer<\/span><\/span><\/strong>: <strong><em><u>100% Vendor Fee Discount<\/u><br>\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <u>100% Deposit Guarantee<\/u><\/em><\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong><em>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0 <u>100% Satisfaction Guarantee<\/u><\/em><\/strong>","Email":"momentsthatmatterphotography@gmail.com","IpAddress":"189.221.252.187","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1280196260,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moments That Matter","Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"69.50.165.212","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79903,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0f11a1c947848f718295df18697aa564","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"mam9p8\"] Congratulations on your upcoming destination wedding! &amp;nbsp;Working with at TA is the best thing you can do to help understand what each resort includes and how they do weddings. &amp;nbsp;That is a great list of resorts to work with so good luck with your plans. &amp;nbsp;Contact us&amp;nbsp;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.wrighttravelagency.com\/leads\/inquiry\/&#039;&gt;here&lt;\/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;if you need anything else.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1910297,"PostDate":1454176833,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"286077\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/286077-mam9p8\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">mam9p8<\/span><\/a> Congratulations on your upcoming destination wedding! \u00a0Working with at TA is the best thing you can do to help understand what each resort includes and how they do weddings. \u00a0That is a great list of resorts to work with so good luck with your plans. \u00a0Contact us\u00a0<a href='http:\/\/www.wrighttravelagency.com\/leads\/inquiry\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>here<\/a>\u00a0if you need anything else.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><b>Preety Jaswal - Canadian Wedding Specialist<\/b><\/p>\n<div style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;font-size:12.8px;\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.wrighttravelagency.com\/go\/destination-wedding\/?source=EMLSIG' title=\"External link\"><strong><span style=\"color:rgb(0,128,128);\">Looking for a travel agency that specializes in Destination Weddings-CLICK HERE<\/span><\/strong><\/a><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:rgb(0,128,128);\"><strong>?<\/strong>\u00a0\u00a0We are an award winning travel agency and you can\u00a0<\/span><strong><span style=\"color:rgb(0,128,128);\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21494-wright-travel-agency-destination-wedding-and-honeymoon-specialists\/' title=\"\">read our reviews\u00a0here.<\/a><\/span><\/strong><\/div>\n","Email":"preety@travelbyplatinum.com","IpAddress":"69.50.165.200","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1448903039,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-285479.jpg?_r=1450836897","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TAPreety","Id":285479,"Name":"TAPreety","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"131.137.245.209","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79903,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"76bb158b029f09966486fe47f3aba680","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;You probably have started - but check out their packages and start asking your TA every question that pops in your head - in Mexico things change daily so its always great to get up to date information.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;If you are a DIY type check out that section on here - these ladies have some seriously awesome ideas&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1913589,"PostDate":1462901294,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>You probably have started - but check out their packages and start asking your TA every question that pops in your head - in Mexico things change daily so its always great to get up to date information.<\/p>\n<p>If you are a DIY type check out that section on here - these ladies have some seriously awesome ideas<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"adamphall@ymail.com","IpAddress":"131.137.245.206","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1462868136,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-286918.jpg?_r=1462901352","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"AdamnJenn17","Id":286918,"Name":"AdamnJenn17","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":4,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":1,"Type":"int"}]}
