sparent-Pinterest-Logo-Icon-660x660_zpscrfyjxqm.png\" alt=\"Transparent-Pinterest-Logo-Icon-660x660_\"><\/a>\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.weddingdaystory.com\/'><img src=\"https:\/\/ci5.googleusercontent.com\/proxy\/MOi09NM6g9spojz5NLnMOwnb6-MW31M3aOTkQcwW8f3wdwfOUH0GzBEk8yCi-BgzM3hAdpIwrU1WHAJK7UztpSr8074FxfGAyPpdRVzR8Xe2Y3_la7JkoGjQ5fEMMlXrmCfTruiTWo--4VbfPoQOn-bX=s0-d-e1-ft#http:\/\/i1042.photobucket.com\/albums\/b425\/Macky_Garcia\/home-icon_zpszd48sned.png?t=1448827209\" alt=\"home-icon_zpszd48sned.png?t=1448827209\"><\/a>\u00a0\u00a0<\/span><span style=\"color:rgb(153,153,153);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:11px;\">\u00b7<\/span><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">\u00a0\u00a0<\/span><span style=\"color:rgb(153,153,153);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12px;\">Subscribe! \u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.weddingdaystory.com\/blog\/'><img src=\"https:\/\/ci3.googleusercontent.com\/proxy\/UDAd86fxy3pU_76L_SJUYy-7ALhkJzmfhgGM4w9EsmCjj3Geq0erBD1C_9H_EMSf0x9E79gBNL_gMWllQzUSc4Ldh3yJ-GDBS2P-yDIelr10wjpkjrcO-MoCyUG_l6CaixKQGpwJ=s0-d-e1-ft#http:\/\/i1042.photobucket.com\/albums\/b425\/Macky_Garcia\/rss%20copy_zpsk7syjhf0.png\" alt=\"rss%20copy_zpsk7syjhf0.png\"><\/a><\/span><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">\u00a0\u00a0<\/span><span style=\"color:rgb(153,153,153);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:11px;\">\u00b7\u00a0<\/span><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">\u00a0<\/span><span style=\"color:rgb(153,153,153);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12px;\">Read our customer's reviews: \u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.weddingwire.com\/reviews\/weddingdaystory-playa-del-carmen-guanacaste\/a22bb30fa39d365c.html'><img src=\"https:\/\/ci4.googleusercontent.com\/proxy\/Yn8ddso_hGdrAOxFk0Zr2iPASI0Zf2mQmXGnilQfDqIhUWXveEKq4WVegJEZRBkWN8OdepvzwiyU5CXXSuIGpLjZp5sIj1x_fVQaWblobBC1KpwPogokAH4gHd56anNO0lfoarqq3ahajmY=s0-d-e1-ft#http:\/\/i1042.photobucket.com\/albums\/b425\/Macky_Garcia\/WW_zpssx812lgw.png?t=1448898098\" alt=\"WW_zpssx812lgw.png?t=1448898098\"><\/a><\/span><\/p>\n<br><p style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10px;\"><b>Latest on the blog!\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.weddingdaystory.com\/blog\/2016\/05\/25\/4781\/unique-riviera-maya-wedding\/'>Adventurous & Unique Riviera Maya Wedding Ideas<\/a><\/b><\/p>\n<p style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10px;\"><b><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.weddingdaystory.com\/blog\/2016\/05\/19\/4722\/best-etsy-wedding-shops-beach-weddings-1\/'>Best Etsy Wedding Shops For Beach Wedding Goodies<\/a><\/b><\/p>\n<p style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:10px;\">\u00a0<img src=\"https:\/\/ci6.googleusercontent.com\/proxy\/IC58KLPvjx5qiFte9UCG8NlhvcBdgOzn0K4IOlwBSmkbzmLneMh7qISqOeNo8VadocIGTEm5ckJxfNvPI-1Ao1gcjrfbj3q5r2X_oDgmUJS1HwuGEwS_JKE8VP2LvORLKw=s0-d-e1-ft#http:\/\/i1042.photobucket.com\/albums\/b425\/Macky_Garcia\/Firma_zpsl6xjfcjx.jpg\" alt=\"Firma_zpsl6xjfcjx.jpg\"><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>info@weddingdaystory.com | www.weddingdaystory.com\/blog","Email":"info@weddingdaystory.com","IpAddress":"187.185.71.174","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1429727488,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282827.jpg?_r=1431453768","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":161,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"WeddingDayStory","Id":282827,"Name":"WeddingDayStory","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.66.4.22","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80037,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1461939290,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8e2dd2cb9e5a2ccd914bbdf005aaff16","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Welcome to our forum community and Congrats on your upcoming destination wedding, WhiteWedding2017!!! As you&#039;ve already seen, there&#039;s a lot of great advice from everyone here, so well done on getting off to a great start already :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;How is your research going - looking for the right wedding venue for your BIG Day?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;For some added inspiration, we&#039;ll leave you with some magical wedding moments that matter we&#039;ve captured in our beautiful Riviera Maya to show you what a backdrop they&#039;d make for your photo Wedding Day Love Story....enjoy!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;....from the &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com\/#!Paradisus-Wedding\/k7mfu\/569274d90cf2e94e3fb07160&#039;&gt;Paradisus PdC Wedding Story Album: &lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_c97703dcea314df8a7aec0c8a8ff2f0f.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_c97703dcea314df8a7aec0c8a8ff2f0f.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_c97703dcea314df8a7aec0c8a8ff2f0f.\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_a4c97b08d0fe4c87aea2b328ab0ec970.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_a4c97b08d0fe4c87aea2b328ab0ec970.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_a4c97b08d0fe4c87aea2b328ab0ec970.\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;....or the &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com\/#!Iberostar-Paraiso-Mayan-Riviera-Wedding\/k7mfu\/56c23b360cf2623709992659&#039;&gt;Iberostar Paraiso Mayan Riviera Wedding Story Album:&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_bb4c7913bd45402589d11da9783624a6.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_bb4c7913bd45402589d11da9783624a6.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_bb4c7913bd45402589d11da9783624a6.\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_52e93c80f4b245818d8b8a7ba39da1d5.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_553,h_830,al_c,q_90,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01\/e89d55_52e93c80f4b245818d8b8a7ba39da1d5.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_52e93c80f4b245818d8b8a7ba39da1d5.\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_a112089c12c7426ba2295b3a00515445.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_a112089c12c7426ba2295b3a00515445.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_a112089c12c7426ba2295b3a00515445.\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Hope you find the best answers for your planning questions, and Enjoy your amazing journey ahead - cheers!!! team MTM :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1913195,"PostDate":1461939257,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Welcome to our forum community and Congrats on your upcoming destination wedding, WhiteWedding2017!!! As you've already seen, there's a lot of great advice from everyone here, so well done on getting off to a great start already <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>How is your research going - looking for the right wedding venue for your BIG Day?<\/p>\n<p>For some added inspiration, we'll leave you with some magical wedding moments that matter we've captured in our beautiful Riviera Maya to show you what a backdrop they'd make for your photo Wedding Day Love Story....enjoy!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>....from the <a href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com\/#!Paradisus-Wedding\/k7mfu\/569274d90cf2e94e3fb07160' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Paradisus PdC Wedding Story Album: <\/a><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_c97703dcea314df8a7aec0c8a8ff2f0f.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_c97703dcea314df8a7aec0c8a8ff2f0f.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_c97703dcea314df8a7aec0c8a8ff2f0f.\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_a4c97b08d0fe4c87aea2b328ab0ec970.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_a4c97b08d0fe4c87aea2b328ab0ec970.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_a4c97b08d0fe4c87aea2b328ab0ec970.\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>....or the <a href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com\/#!Iberostar-Paraiso-Mayan-Riviera-Wedding\/k7mfu\/56c23b360cf2623709992659' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Iberostar Paraiso Mayan Riviera Wedding Story Album:<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_bb4c7913bd45402589d11da9783624a6.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_bb4c7913bd45402589d11da9783624a6.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_bb4c7913bd45402589d11da9783624a6.\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_52e93c80f4b245818d8b8a7ba39da1d5.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_553,h_830,al_c,q_90,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01\/e89d55_52e93c80f4b245818d8b8a7ba39da1d5.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_52e93c80f4b245818d8b8a7ba39da1d5.\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_a112089c12c7426ba2295b3a00515445.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_a112089c12c7426ba2295b3a00515445.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_a112089c12c7426ba2295b3a00515445.\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Hope you find the best answers for your planning questions, and Enjoy your amazing journey ahead - cheers!!! team MTM <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/i1378.photobucket.com\/albums\/ah106\/ContactIDoMexico\/MTM%20Logo%202016_zps4tzm05my.png\" alt=\"MTM%20Logo%202016_zps4tzm05my.png\"><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com'><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Moments That Matter Photography , Cancun, Playa del Carmen, Mexico<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Canadian Award Winning Photojournalist serving the Riviera Maya<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Email: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com'>contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#0000cd;\"><strong>Why we're Ranked #1<\/strong><\/span> ~ Scoop on what we do:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21512-moments-that-matter-photography\/'>MTM Reviews<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Meet Lincoln & Team MTM: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/vimeo.com\/51032621'>\"Meet Lincoln\" Video + see his Passion!!!<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#0000cd;\"><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', cursive;\">We Offer<\/span><\/span><\/strong>: <strong><em><u>100% Vendor Fee Discount<\/u><br>\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <u>100% Deposit Guarantee<\/u><\/em><\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong><em>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0 <u>100% Satisfaction Guarantee<\/u><\/em><\/strong>","Email":"momentsthatmatterphotography@gmail.com","IpAddress":"189.221.252.187","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1280196260,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moments That Matter","Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"64.121.129.68","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80037,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ecbcb82e99dfa31c65534f29d46621de","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"WhiteWedding2017\"] have you checked out the Karisma properties? this is where i decided to get married after months of research and comparisons! they have adults only resorts (el dorado) and family friendly (azul &amp;amp; generations), so depending on your guest list, you can narrow down the options. the wedding coordinators have been super easy to work with and my travel agent has been an amazing help as well! she is taking care of EVERYTHING for me and is even able to answer some questions before the wedding planner does!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1913452,"PostDate":1462811014,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"286708\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/286708-whitewedding2017\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">WhiteWedding2017<\/span><\/a> have you checked out the Karisma properties? this is where i decided to get married after months of research and comparisons! they have adults only resorts (el dorado) and family friendly (azul & generations), so depending on your guest list, you can narrow down the options. the wedding coordinators have been super easy to work with and my travel agent has been an amazing help as well! she is taking care of EVERYTHING for me and is even able to answer some questions before the wedding planner does!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"embow345@aol.com","IpAddress":"64.121.129.68","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1447175587,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ekf6189","Id":285293,"Name":"ekf6189","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"122.15.103.61","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80037,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6e58590381aa1f37d7e827513b78e74a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:&#039;Source Sans Pro&#039;, sans-serif;font-size:17px;\"&gt;Mexico charms with colorful culture, sophisticated local vendors, 6,000 miles of Pacific and Caribbean coast, and plenty of tequila. Generally people prefer beach wedding there.&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/www.destinationweddingmag.com\/sites\/destinationweddingmag.com\/files\/styles\/large_1x_\/public\/import\/2014\/files\/_images\/201406\/cancun-mexico-wedding-beach-wedding.jpg?itok=8jELpME9\" alt=\"cancun-mexico-wedding-beach-wedding.jpg?\"&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bharatkirayabhandar.com\/&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.bharatkirayabhandar.com\/&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1913469,"PostDate":1462850976,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><span  style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:'Source Sans Pro', sans-serif;font-size:17px;\">Mexico charms with colorful culture, sophisticated local vendors, 6,000 miles of Pacific and Caribbean coast, and plenty of tequila. Generally people prefer beach wedding there.<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/www.destinationweddingmag.com\/sites\/destinationweddingmag.com\/files\/styles\/large_1x_\/public\/import\/2014\/files\/_images\/201406\/cancun-mexico-wedding-beach-wedding.jpg?itok=8jELpME9\" alt=\"cancun-mexico-wedding-beach-wedding.jpg?\"><\/span><a href='http:\/\/www.bharatkirayabhandar.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.bharatkirayabhandar.com\/<\/a><\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"katherineriverace@gmail.com","IpAddress":"122.15.103.61","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1425086317,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282278.png?_r=1425103909","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":242,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"RitvikSehgal","Id":282278,"Name":"RitvikSehgal","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"201.116.201.71","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80037,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"276a279bd40cb7bd99182c6f789aa448","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi Ladies,&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;First of all congratulations of your upcoming destination Wedding!! Are you looking for the perfect wedding venue? Allow me to tell you about our venue Las Caletas.. &amp;nbsp;We are located on Puerto Vallarta Mexico, one of the most beautiful ports of the Pacific..&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;Las Caletas is our Private Hideaway, surrounded by the Magnificent &amp;nbsp;Sierra Madre mountains and exotic vegetation..&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;The team of Adventure Weddings coordinators will be attending you personally and making this adventure totally stress free.. let the pictures talk by themselves.&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:83039]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:83038]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:83034]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:83037]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:82915]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:81816]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:80966]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:80965]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:79015]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:41682]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:41509]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;Adventure Weddings&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;Puerto Vallarta, M\u00e9xico&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;Toll free: 1 866.822.26.97&lt;\/div&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1913771,"PostDate":1463421819,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi Ladies,<\/p>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>First of all congratulations of your upcoming destination Wedding!! Are you looking for the perfect wedding venue? Allow me to tell you about our venue Las Caletas.. \u00a0We are located on Puerto Vallarta Mexico, one of the most beautiful ports of the Pacific..<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>Las Caletas is our Private Hideaway, surrounded by the Magnificent \u00a0Sierra Madre mountains and exotic vegetation..<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>The team of Adventure Weddings coordinators will be attending you personally and making this adventure totally stress free.. let the pictures talk by themselves.<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/83039-ceremony-in-blue\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_18083\/sml_gallery_258213_18083_2664466.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='Ceremony in blue'  width='200' height='134'  alt='Ceremony in blue' id='sml_image_view_83039' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/83038-flowers-everywhere\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_18083\/sml_gallery_258213_18083_81524.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='Flowers everywhere'  width='200' height='134'  alt='Flowers everywhere' id='sml_image_view_83038' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/83034-ceremony-at-paradise\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_18083\/sml_gallery_258213_18083_2597851.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='ceremony at paradise'  width='200' height='134'  alt='ceremony at paradise' id='sml_image_view_83034' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/83037-palm-arch-and-greenery-for-the-aisle\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_18083\/sml_gallery_258213_18083_3730948.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='palm arch and greenery for the aisle'  width='200' height='134'  alt='palm arch and greenery for the aisle' id='sml_image_view_83037' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/82915-ad-200216-201\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_18066\/sml_gallery_258213_18066_4007129.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='A&D 200216 201'  width='200' height='134'  alt='A&D 200216 201' id='sml_image_view_82915' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/81816-reception-in-las-caletas\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17896\/sml_gallery_258213_17896_486766.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='Reception in Las Caletas'  width='200' height='122'  alt='Reception in Las Caletas' id='sml_image_view_81816' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/80966-awcr-04042014-439\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17896\/sml_gallery_258213_17896_170869.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='awcr 04042014 439'  width='200' height='134'  alt='awcr 04042014 439' id='sml_image_view_80966' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/80965-awcg-17042014-326\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17896\/sml_gallery_258213_17896_196159.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='awcg 17042014 326'  width='200' height='134'  alt='awcg 17042014 326' id='sml_image_view_80965' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/79015-ready\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17896\/sml_gallery_258213_17896_726279.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='ready'  width='200' height='134'  alt='ready' id='sml_image_view_79015' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/41682-no-caption\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_11364\/sml_gallery_59784_11364_1386230337_179071.jpeg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='No caption'  width='200' height='134'  alt='No caption' id='sml_image_view_41682' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/41509-no-caption\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_11264\/sml_gallery_59784_11264_1386230330_178852.jpeg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='No caption'  width='200' height='134'  alt='No caption' id='sml_image_view_41509' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>Adventure Weddings<\/div>\n<div>Puerto Vallarta, M\u00e9xico<\/div>\n<div>Toll free: 1 866.822.26.97<\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"dennise@adventureweddingsvallarta.com","IpAddress":"187.146.166.254","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1343044403,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-258213.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LasCaletas","Id":258213,"Name":"LasCaletas","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":10,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":1,"Type":"int"}]}